	(text "MCU - ESP32-C3-MINI-1-H4X (Datasheet v2.2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "35e32a09-7313-4b5f-87bd-e9d4b4298b3f"))
	(text "Alimentacao 3V3 (3,0-3,6 V). EN com RC de 10 k + 1 uF (p.34).\nStrapping (Tabela 4-3, p.13): GPIO9=1 no boot (pull-up 4k7 + botao BOOT);\nGPIO8=1 para download (pull-up 4k7, tambem SDA); GPIO2 com pull-up (recomendado).\nGPIO18/19 = USB Serial/JTAG. GPIO20/21 = UART0 (console): ver decisoes.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc9d0018-81af-404d-a518-12ed9df4acd8"))
